		{
			dependencies: [
				"785F8750269787D7"
				"179C0661067020AF"
			]
			description: ["收集 x3 凋零骷髅头颅"]
			id: "04CFA7792019A4A3"
			rewards: [{
				id: "4C9AAC05B89E4146"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					ForgeCaps: {
						"celestisynth:celestisynthitemstackcapabilities": {
							cs.aquaSkin: 0
						}
					}
					id: "minecraft:written_book"
					tag: {
						author: "Mr6trt"
						pages: [
							"{\"text\":\"Her name is not written.\\nNot in the books of kings, not in the records of war.\\nBut in the ashes of the Nether, they still whisper her name through the bones.She came not from the skies, nor from flame, but from silence — a soldier born in a shattered world.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Where others fled, she remained. Where walls broke, she stood. For centuries, she guarded the border between realms, her axe singing through the crimson storms.She never loved. Not because she could not, but because war leaves little room for the heart to breathe.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"In the final days, when the obsidian bastions cracked and the legions of flame poured forth, she led the last charge. Her armor was ruined. Her blood, already dark. A shadow had touched her, a skeletal blade, cold and cursed.She knew it then: the end had come for her.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"But she did not stop. She did not yield.\\n\\nDeep within the burning halls of the Nether’s heart, she faced the Three — the chaos bound in bone and soul. The Wither.\\n\\nAnd she won.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"But the poison was already in her. As her breath grew still, she made one final vow: that her broken heart would not die in vain. Her weapon, soaked in corrupted essence, was to be reforged. Not to destroy — but to seal.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"The smiths of shadow heard her will. They gathered what little hope remained:\\nAn eye darkened by corruption.\\nAnother that once belonged to the Watchers of Bone.\\nDroplets, like tears, cursed and still warm.\\nA scroll written in language long lost to fire.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"Roses that bloom only where death walks.\\nSkulls that laugh without breath.\\n\\nAnd something else... something never spoken.\\nA weight beyond numbers. A silence never broken.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"They say the forging lasted nine days and nine nights. On the final hour, her ashes were scattered into the mold, and the Broken Heart was born.\\n\\nIt thirsts for justice. For vengeance.\\nFor her.\"}"
							"{\"text\":\"The axe waits in silence.\\nIt calls not to the strong, but to the weary.\\nTo those who carry pain like armor.\\nTo those who fight, not to win — but to endure.\\n\\nAnd in the end… it remembers her.\"}"
						]
						title: "破碎的心"
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				count: 3L
				id: "58A6B4BFC40B57C4"
